    :rationaleText " Adversaries coerce systems into authenticating to attacker-controlled SMB or WebDAV resources in order to capture credential material. This control requires traffic filtering between network segments, which can block or tightly restrict SMB and WebDAV communications to untrusted or unauthorized destinations, directly preventing the outbound authentication path required by the technique." ;
    :referenceUrl "https://cas.docs.cisecurity.org/en/latest/source/Controls13/#134-perform-traffic-filtering-between-network-segments"^^xsd:anyURI ;
