    :rationaleText "Code-level security checks within the application lifecycle can identify vulnerable, malicious, or unexpected code and software components introduced through software supply-chain compromise. This relationship applies to software and development-chain compromise that can be detected through static, dynamic, dependency, integrity, or release-pipeline analysis." ;
    :referenceUrl "https://cas.docs.cisecurity.org/en/latest/source/Controls16/#1612-implement-code-level-security-checks"^^xsd:anyURI ;
