    :rationaleText "Production and non-production container or virtualization infrastructure can be placed behind separate gateways, firewalls, or control-plane boundaries so a compromised non-production system cannot directly reach production hosts used to build images." ;
    :referenceUrl "https://cas.docs.cisecurity.org/en/latest/source/Controls16/#168-separate-production-and-non-production-systems"^^xsd:anyURI ;
