    :assertsTechnique data:technique_T1071.004 ;
    :rationaleText "The firewall can force devices to use approved DNS resolvers and block direct DNS traffic to external systems. It does not by itself identify malicious data embedded in DNS traffic sent through an approved resolver." ;
    :sourceRecordNumber 884 .

data:cisassertion_CIS-4.5_T1071.005 a :MitigatesAssertion ;
