    :rationaleText "Remediating vulnerabilities in host kernels, hypervisors, and container runtimes reduces successful container or virtual-machine escape. This does not prevent escapes caused solely by unsafe configuration, privileged containers, or exposed management sockets." ;
    :referenceUrl "https://cas.docs.cisecurity.org/en/latest/source/Controls7/#77-remediate-detected-vulnerabilities"^^xsd:anyURI ;
