    :assertsTechnique data:technique_T1068 ;
    :rationaleText "Browsers and email clients are common targets for vulnerabilities. Requiring the latest vendor-supported versions directly reduces exposure to known client-software vulnerabilities." ;
    :sourceRecordNumber 741 .

